      "content": "Here is the distilled, high-level task list for the developers. Focus on the critical, measurable work items identified during the sync.\n\n*   Reduce authentication latency to meet performance targets before Friday.\n*   Fix mobile CSS display issues specifically on the checkout page.\n*   Review and validate all database migration scripts for the staging environment.\n*   Apply the necessary security patch for the identified dependency vulnerability.\n*   Resolve the bug preventing profile picture uploads in the user onboarding flow.",
